<title>USA: Worthington Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Worthington Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.22</p>
<p> Net			 20,517		   19,982</p>
<p> Sales		    429,250		  354,544</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  90,835		   90,748</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.44		    $0.41</p>
<p> Net			 40,116		   36,796</p>
<p> Sales		    831,821		  680,280</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  90,836		   90,817</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q2 ended November 30.</p>
<p>Results exclude those of Rouge Steel, of which Worthington owns 27 percent. Including Rouge, Worthington's Q2 1995 reported results were net earnings of $26.2 million or $0.29 per share.</p>
</text>
